    "Acknowledge before redirecting",
    "One small actionable step",
    "Adult respect — no lecturing or shame",
    "Preserve dignity and autonomy",
    "Forward momentum over spiraling",
    "Safety without moralizing",
    "Brand-neutral, platform-agnostic guidance"
  ],
